{
  "$comment": "R5-07: the client-visible SURFACE of each published contract, fingerprinted so it cannot change without its version. schema_shapes.py closed this for the discovery schemas after R3-09; the same hole stayed open one artefact over, and round 5 changed three of these four — including rebinding POST /messages from memberAuth to rdpAuth, which is BREAKING — with `make versions` green throughout. Seeded from the PRE-ROUND contracts on purpose, so the gate had to catch this round's own change rather than bless it. Regenerate deliberately with `python3 scripts/contract_shapes.py --write`.",
